Hypothesis: The bug is in add(): on replacement of an existing item that previously held the cached min or max, it relies on updateBounds(), but updateBounds() does not recompute bounds across the whole dataset. Therefore the cached range becomes based only on the new item rather than all remaining items, producing incorrect rangeBounds after replacements.

